#1500
A Road Leading From The Bank~
   A small stony road leads up from the bank of the River of Lost Souls,
whose dark water can be heard just to the south. Sheer cliffs close in on
either hand. Penitents have tied scraps of cloth to the thorn bushes here,
one for each sin they mean to lay down, and the bushes are heavy with them.
To the north a path runs straight as a drawn line into the mountain.
~
