#1501
A Long Road~
   You stand at the start of a long road in a great hollow silence. Your
first step has been taken freely, which is all the road asks at the start;
the truth of your heart is not yet told. A small white child stands guard
here. If you are not ready, turn back south and do not come again until you
are. The road runs north.
~
