#1502
A Long Road~
   You stop, and find you are shouting in frustration. Of everything you
regret, surely that one sin could have been avoided. The blows and the hurt
you gave flash before your eyes, and for a moment the pain is yours. Then it
passes, and the straight road shows itself again, running north. Behind you
it runs south to the river.
~
