#1505
A Test for the Faithful~
   Here the road parts and the first choice must be made. A stair climbs up
toward a pale light; another goes down into darkness. Only the depths of
your own soul can choose between them, but the Watchers of the Road say this
much: the same truth waits at the end of both, and the Weigher waits behind
the truth.
~
