#1506
Halls of the Forgotten~
   Even the darkest have a place on the road to the truth. It is in these
empty halls, long forgotten by the living, that the Weigher has gathered the
worst of men to look upon them one last time. Passages lead east and west
into the dark, and the stair climbs back up to the parting of the ways.
