#1508
Earthly Evil~
   Whatever it holds, rage makes a weapon of it. Wrath arms everyone. When
an angry man thirsts for blood anything at all will serve him for a spear,
and fury turns a stick into a cudgel. The floor is littered with such
things: sticks, stones, a broken bottle, a cook's knife. The way leads
north, and east back to the halls.
~
