Earthly Light~
   Slipping into evil is easy; walking this way is the hardest thing of all.
Even the four you will meet ahead strayed from the line at least once, and
there are still some who curse their names. Confront them all the same, and
let what they did be your example. The way runs north, and east back to the
vow.
