#1519
The Light of the Stewards~
   Many believed Oswen the First Pilgrim could never die, but when they
stood over his body they saw they must keep the road without him. The four
who came after are called the Stewards, the rightly-guided, who carried his
lantern and his word and built the great pilgrim houses of the old east. The
way runs north and south.
