#1520
The Light of the Stewards~
   Each Steward was chosen by a council of elders, every one of whom hoped
to rule the road alone and so voted for the man he thought weakest. Each
time, they were wrong. Each Steward was nobler and more upright than the one
before. A tall, plain man waits here, unwilling to fight. The way runs north
and south.
