The Final Facing~
   The middle of the gallery of the Final Facing. Here every pilgrim must
turn and look at all they have been, the dark below and the bright above,
and own both. Only the penitent find what they seek. The straight road goes
on north; the gallery runs east and west, and stairs go up and down.
