#1537
A Straight Path~
   "Keeper of the Scales, be patient with us. We are crooked, and the road
is straight. Hold up the lantern a little longer, and we will come." So the
pilgrims sing as they reach this place, and their voices still hang in the
air. The road runs straight ahead to the north, and the gallery lies south.
~
